(text "USB-C laptop interface - independent enumeration and isolated UART" (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid a7aede18-44f1-4840-9285-7ec1d64337aa))
(text "USB_GND and scoring GND are separate domains. U18 uses the external 3.3V regulator (VREGIN tied to VDD).\nUSB_AWAKE is SUSPENDb: low after reset/unconfigured and in USB suspend; R75 holds it low while reset floats the pin.\nU19 defaults HIGH (UART idle). STM32 USART2 uses PA2 TX and PA15 RX; USART1 to ESP32 and SWD remain independent.\nNo USB remote wake or UART hardware flow control. Use bounded framed messages with sequence/credit control.\nSource qualification and the isolated power gate are on usb-power-control. USB_AWAKE alone does not authorize 1.5A.\nCP210x VCP driver and desktop transport adapter required; native STM32 USB DFU is not connected on this board." (at 20.32 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1490af9d-16ea-48ca-a0f5-354ce395931c))
