(text "TPS70933 accepts raw VBUS up to 30V; EN is intentionally open (internal pull-up), never tied to high-voltage VBUS.\nC40 is 4.7uF to meet its output-capacitance requirement. R76 senses only the protected 5V rail.\nThe bridge therefore sees VBUS absent during input overvoltage while the power controller remains alive." (at 20.32 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2088c10d-e2d1-41f2-8b02-ff32a3f31f44))
)
